{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0037-s001", "text": "Alla barn som bor permanent i Finland har läroplikt mellan 7 och 18 års ålder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020658810644+0000-1/hb-c08-u0037-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.451019287109375, "generation_seconds": 13.878116922918707, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0037-s002", "text": "Barn och unga deltar först i den grundläggande utbildningen, det vill säga årskurserna 1–9, eller inhämtar på annat sätt kunskaper som motsvarar den grundläggande utbildningens lärokurs.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020658810644+0000-1/hb-c08-u0037-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 16.300408163265306, "peak": 0.290008544921875, "generation_seconds": 30.79212091700174, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0037-s003", "text": "Efter den grundläggande utbildningen ska alla unga dessutom studera till exempel på en utbildning på andra stadiet, tills de utexamineras eller fyller 18 år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020658810644+0000-1/hb-c08-u0037-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.722993197278912, "peak": 0.35504150390625, "generation_seconds": 23.40848818491213, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0037-s004", "text": "Det har ursprungligen föreskrivits om läroplikten i Finland redan år 1921.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020658810644+0000-1/hb-c08-u0037-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.238067626953125, "generation_seconds": 13.756020531058311, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0038-s001", "text": "Barnets föräldrar eller vårdnadshavare ska se till att barnet fullgör sin läroplikt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020658810644+0000-1/hb-c08-u0038-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.253387451171875, "generation_seconds": 12.237560731824487, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0038-s002", "text": "Om vårdnadshavarna inte sörjer för barnets läroplikt, kan en domstol utdöma påföljder till dem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020658810644+0000-1/hb-c08-u0038-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.498503401360544, "peak": 0.281768798828125, "generation_seconds": 14.720739956945181, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0038-s003", "text": "Största delen av barnen studerar i kommunala grundskolor, men det finns också privata skolor och statliga skolor.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020658810644+0000-1/hb-c08-u0038-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.961360544217687, "peak": 0.30657958984375, "generation_seconds": 16.713633763836697, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0039-s001", "text": "Den grundläggande utbildningen, det vill säga grundskolan, omfattar årskurserna 1–9.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-grundskola/narration/resume-20261103T020658810644+0000-1/hb-c08-u0039-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.289523809523809, "peak": 0.277099609375, "generation_seconds": 13.962004609871656, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
